    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate Chess Experience. Master the board, conquer the mind!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divinity Chess stands at the forefront of chess interfaces, offering an immersive 3D experience and full integration with powerful analytic engines like Stockfish. With a vast database of grandmaster games, players can explore the depths of chess history to hone their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playback approximately 1,000,000 Grandmaster Games, move by move! Grandmasters include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Garry Kasparov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hikaru Nakamura</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Magnus Carlsen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Viswanathan Anand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and of course many, many more!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208690/extras/78d0d59842ee88b8b8ca19fa93168825.avif?t=1728011444\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive 3D experience with Divinity Chess interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play against the number one rated game engine in the World known as Stockfish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Extensive database of grandmaster games for in-depth study</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lichess connectivity - Download and playback the latest games! (Based on availability)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seamless saving, loading, and sharing of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playback feature for thorough analysis of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208690/extras/214947342e1532d5ac26033d230889b2.avif?t=1728011444\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p>",
